What are Embedded Design Services?
Embedded Design Services encompass comprehensive hardware-software co-development solutions that address critical engineering challenges including system architecture design, firmware integration, and certification testing. These services have become indispensable as electronic systems grow more complex, particularly with the proliferation of IoT, AI, and edge computing applications. By outsourcing embedded design, companies can significantly reduce R&D risks while accelerating time-to-market for connected products ranging from smart appliances to industrial robotics.
